      "type": "spotlight",
      "item": "tribalpower:ember_kiln",
      "text": [
        "The Fire station smelts with Pulse instead of coal. Whatever a furnace smelts, the Kiln smelts: cobble becomes stone, grit becomes an ingot. It needs a Fire totem within 8 blocks."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Using it",
      "text": [
        "Feed it any furnace input and take the furnace result. No fuel is burned.",
        "Each smelt takes **10 seconds** at **32 Pulse a second** before pack settings; the default 2.0 consumption multiplier doubles that.",
        "Grit always fires into its ingot, even modded grit a furnace cannot read.",
        "A lever pauses it, and so does a full output. Missing Fire pauses it and spends nothing."
      ]
    },
