    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Automating it",
      "text": [
        "Sit Echo Shatter on the Kiln, Output into Input, so grit walks down: that is the default for a station sitting on another, so it just works. [Metals and gems](metals_and_gems) shows a whole ore line.",
        "Put a hopper or cache under it if you want the ingots collected.",
        "Rank it in Echo Attune, Bind, then Manifest like any other workshop."
